---
// Home page: the local, one-person promise. No photo by design.
---
<section id="meet"><div class="wrap two">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Who you'll work with</div>
    <h2>A real person,<br><span class="grad serif">right down the road.</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="reveal">
    <p class="sub">I'm Ryan. I came to this from construction, so I know what it's like to run jobs all day and do the office work at night. 1337 is a small local studio: you deal with me, not a call center.</p>
    <ul class="meet-list">
      <li>Start with a free 30-minute call. You get a written list of fixes, each with a flat price.</li>
      <li>Every quote is in writing. 50% to start, 50% at launch.</li>
      <li>You own everything once it's paid.</li>
      <li>Serving Northwest Indiana and Chicagoland.</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn primary magnetic" href="/contact/">Book a free call <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<style>
.meet-list{margin-top:22px;display:grid;gap:12px;padding:0;list-style:none}
.meet-list li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;color:var(--mute)}
.meet-list li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.62em;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ink)}
</style>
